OL,3,ACrossCountry train services resume
OL,4,Aafter outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday morning, CrossCountry
OL,7,Freported a handful of service
OL,8,Fcancellations, although these were put
OL,9,Fdown to trains departing late and staff
OL,10,Fshortages.
